## PHẦN 7: CẤU HÌNH MẪU HOÀN CHỈNH

### 7.1 PowerShell script

```powershell
# Set proxy với socks5h (remote DNS)
$env:HTTPS_PROXY = "socks5h://user:pass@192.168.1.100:1080"
$env:HTTP_PROXY  = "socks5h://user:pass@192.168.1.100:1080"
$env:NO_PROXY    = "localhost,127.0.0.1"

# Test
.\rclone.exe lsd mega:

# Đẩy file
.\rclone.exe copy "D:\data\bigfile.7z" mega:/backup/ `
  --progress `
  --transfers 4 `
  --checkers 8 `
  --retries 5 `
  -vv
```

### 7.2 Nếu SOCKS không cần auth

```powershell
$env:HTTPS_PROXY = "socks5h://192.168.1.100:1080"
$env:HTTP_PROXY  = "socks5h://192.168.1.100:1080"
```

### 7.3 Nếu dùng HTTP proxy thay SOCKS

```powershell
$env:HTTPS_PROXY = "http://user:pass@proxy:8080"
$env:HTTP_PROXY  = "http://user:pass@proxy:8080"
```

HTTP proxy **tự động remote DNS** — không có vấn đề `socks5` vs `socks5h`.

